				<r3d:description language="eng">The purpose of this central repository is to gather all the research data created by Greek researchers and academics from Greek Universities, and make them available in the most open and secure way possible.
 HARDMIN has been developed with the open software CKAN and, along with HELIX, constitutes the national digital research infrastructure (eInfrastructure) software for cataloguing services and research data repository, part of the Open Access infrastructure of Heal-Link. The repository provides the capability to connect to already established repositories and extract data from existing collections.</r3d:description>
